[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3482.23, "timestamp": "00:58:02", "text": "タワー第一タワーエリア。   ここに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3489.349, "timestamp": "00:58:09", "text": "私は何者？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3492.549, "timestamp": "00:58:12", "text": "トイレットペーパーは使えません。 なぜ？ ここに来て。 ここに来て"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3493.99, "timestamp": "00:58:13", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3496.63, "timestamp": "00:58:16", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3500.15, "timestamp": "00:58:20", "text": "だからパルワールドでは、そういう風にテレポートすることはできないんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3503.51, "timestamp": "00:58:23", "text": "だから、私たちはこれらのうちのどれかを見つけて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3506.71, "timestamp": "00:58:26", "text": "それに近づく必要がある。 ファストトラベルを押すと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3509.51, "timestamp": "00:58:29", "text": "DPに行けるようになります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3517.109, "timestamp": "00:58:37", "text": "ああ、そういうことだったのか。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3517.51, "timestamp": "00:58:37", "text": "はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3520.309, "timestamp": "00:58:40", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3522.39, "timestamp": "00:58:42", "text": "ズボンと一緒に寝られるよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3525.349, "timestamp": "00:58:45", "text": "何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3526.309, "timestamp": "00:58:46", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3527.27, "timestamp": "00:58:47", "text": "どこにいるの？"}]